Id: ldap002w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: check_ldap
Fix: Configure TLS (olcTLSCertificateFile) and require it (olcSecurity minssf), or take it off the network.
References: slapd.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 3.10; NIST SC-8; ISO 5.14, 8.24

The directory takes binds with no TLS configured. The passwords
cross the network in clear, to whoever listens. Give it a
certificate and demand encryption, or take it off the network.
